# Compact
# `contract/src/managed` is the compiled contract output (bindings, prover/verifier keys, zkir).
# It's committed on purpose: platforms like Vercel run `npm run build` without the Compact
# compiler installed, so the compiled output must already be present in the repo for the build
# (and the UI's `cp -r ../contract/src/managed/...` step) to succeed. Only build-output copies of
# it under `dist/` (already covered by the `dist/` rule above) stay ignored.
managed/
!contract/src/managed/
!contract/src/managed/**

.claude
.midnight-expert
.vercel
.env*
